                              initial value: EC j = DC j , j = 1 ∼ n                            (8)
      However, for the directed network we build, the above analysis process only takes the im-
  portance of neighboring nodes into account. To increase the inﬂuence of the nodes themselves
  on the outside, we modify the equation based on the PageRank idea.
      PageRank[2] is an algorithm proposed by Sergey Brin and Lawrence Page to rank the im-
