      To investigate the nature of the MI distribution, we ﬁt the frequency distribution curve of
  MI. Observe that the distribution of MI in the ﬁgure resembles a power-law distribution, so
  the complementary cumulative distribution function of the power-law distribution is deﬁned as
  equation(11)

                                  P(X|X > x) = cx−a ,       c > 0, a > 0                                    (11)




                                                                型
      We solve for the power-law distribution parameters using the maximum likelihood estima-
