      With the goodness of ﬁt R2 = 0.9931, we can consider that the Musical Inﬂuence Network
  is a scale-free network. Musical inﬂuence network obeys the law of Pareto Principle, i.e., only
                                                        ：
  a small number of musicians inﬂuence many other musicians, while most musicians do not
  inﬂuence other musicians. This also means that a small number of highly inﬂuential musicians




                                                       els
  will have an impact on the music world. And this will be analyzed in detail in the subsequent
                               号
